# Files in this repo that should NOT be served as part of the public site.
#
# The repo is public (that is fine — nothing secret is in it), but there
# is no reason to publish server source or CI config at a URL.

worker/
.github/
docs/
node_modules/
package.json
package-lock.json
wrangler.jsonc
.assetsignore
.gitignore
README.md

# tests/ IS intentionally published: tests/visual-check.html is a useful
# pre-class tool for checking a theme reads on the projector.
